Gentle ping on this one — two weeks in, no review yet, so I want to make sure it isn't just sitting in the wrong queue.

Still accurate as of today: `+80/-26` in one file, merges cleanly with current `main` (three upstream commits have touched `flash_attn.py` since I branched; none of them overlap the regions this changes), and CI hasn't run on it yet.

@LucasWilkinson @MatthewBonanni — if you two aren't the right reviewers for FA2-specific changes, I'd appreciate a pointer to whoever is. And if anything would make this easier to review, I'm happy to do it: rebase, split the change, add a targeted test for the split path, or rerun the benchmarks on A800/H200 with different shapes or models.

